Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been looking at your um at your website and you do talk about uh Nvidia's being a platform.\N我看了下你们的网站，你们确实提到英伟达是一个平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?\N那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,A platform.\N一个平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,A platform is something that you build other things upon.\N平台就是你用来构建其他事物的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:23.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is the largest pure play technology company the United States has ever seen.\N英伟达是美国有史以来最大的纯技术公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're the largest pure play technology company the world's ever known.\N事实上，我们是世界上最大的纯技术公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We create technology out of nothing.\N我们从无到有创造技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our final product is pure technology.\N我们的最终产品是纯技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:42.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in order to use it, you have to create software and applications for various industries above it.\N要使用它，你必须为其之上各个行业开发相应的软件和应用。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:48.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, if you look at most of the technology companies today, some of it could be in social media, some of it could be in e-commerce,\N你知道，看看如今大多数科技公司，有些可能在社交媒体领域，有些可能在电子商务领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,some of it could be in information search and and these are all amazing technology companies whose business models are something else.\N其中一些可能涉及信息搜索，而这些都是一流的科技公司，它们的商业模式更是别具一格。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our business model is purely technology.\N我们的商业模式纯粹是技术驱动的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:01:04.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the way that that AI works and and uh our technology works is that in the final analysis the\N现在，人工智能的工作方式以及我们的技术运作方式是，最终来说，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,technology platform is built in layers and that's one of the reasons why we think of it as a platform.\N技术平台是分层构建的，这也是我们将其视为平台的原因之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:12.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're standing on top of it.\N你正站在它的上面。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:16.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,An application or an industry stands on top of that platform.\N一个应用或一个行业都建立在该平台之上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:19.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,That platform starts with energy on the bottom.\N该平台的基础是底层的能源。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:27.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So layer one is energy, layer two are essentially the chips and systems.\N第一层是能源，第二层本质上是芯片和系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the chips that's where Nvidia comes in layer three is a whole bunch of software and we build a\N但芯片才是英伟达发力的地方，第三层是一整套软件，我们正在构建
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:38.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,whole bunch of software on top of our chips and we're well known for this piece of software called CUDA.\N我们芯片上运行着大量软件，而我们最出名的就是这款名为 CUDA 的软件。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there's hundreds of different pieces of software that we create that enables people to do\N但我们开发了数百种不同的软件，让人们能够实现各种操作。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI for different fields of science or language or images or whatever it happens to be,\N用于科学、语言、图像等各个领域的AI，无论它具体涉及什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,robotics or manufacturing and such.\N机器人或制造等领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that third layer is called infrastructure.\N但第三层被称为基础设施。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Basically software now people historically have thought of infrastructure really as cloud.\N基本上，如今人们普遍将基础设施理解为云。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,But increasingly it's really important to realize that infrastructure includes land, power,\N但越来越重要的是要意识到，基础设施包括土地和电力。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,shell because these are and I'll speak about this in a second that this\N因为这些是，我稍后会具体讲到这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,industry spawn another industry altogether and I'll come back to that but the third\N产业催生出全新的产业，我稍后再回到这一点，但第三个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.77,0:02:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,layer is basically infrastructure and that infrastructure includes financial services because it takes an\N底层本质上是基础设施，而基础设施包括金融服务，因为这需要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,enormous amount of capital to do what we do and historically all of that software.\N巨大的资本投入来完成我们所做的事情，以及历史上所有的软件开发。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,the layer above that and this is where people largely focus on when they talk about AI which is the AI models.\N再往上一层就是人们谈论人工智能时主要关注的AI模型。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the revolution, of course: ChatGPT, incredible work that Anthropic does\N这当然是一场革命：ChatGPT，以及 Anthropic 所完成的惊人工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:44.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,with Claude, and Google does with Gemini, and what xAI does with Grok.\N就像谷歌用 Gemini 所做的那样，以及 xAI 用 Grok 所做的那样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:54.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the important thing to realize those are four of the one and a half million AI models in the world.\N但重要的是要意识到，这些只是全球一百五十万个AI模型中的四个。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:03:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,M AI is not just intelligence that understands English or language, but it's AI that understands genes,\NAI 不仅是能理解英语或语言的智能，更是能理解基因的AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,proteins, chemicals, the laws of physics, AI that understands quantum.\N蛋白质、化学品、物理定律，以及理解量子的AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understands physical articulation, otherwise known as robotics.\N能够理解物理联动的AI，也就是机器人技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understands patterns across long sequence of time, financial services,\N能够理解长时间序列中模式的AI，应用于金融服务领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:31.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understand longitudinally across multiple modalities, healthcare.\N能够跨多种模态纵向理解的AI，应用于医疗健康领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so AI has all of these different reaches and domains.\N因此，人工智能涵盖了各个不同的领域和层面。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:37.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about this one area.\N我们谈的是这个领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.99,0:03:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just have to be very careful to understand that AI spans\N我们必须非常谨慎，以理解人工智能的广泛覆盖。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,basically every form of information across every field of science across every single industry.\N几乎涵盖所有科学领域、所有产业中的各类信息。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:53.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,One and a half million AIs around the world.\N全球一百五十万个AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of that are all the applications and we never should forget that in the final\N除此之外还有各种应用，我们绝不能忘记这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:10.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,analysis these AI models are technologies but technologies are about enabling application and use whether you're in healthcare\N分析这些AI模型，它们是技术，而技术的本质在于赋能应用与使用，无论你身处医疗健康领域
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know you could be in entertainment manufacturing self-driving cars transportation each one of these industries have\N你知道，你可能在娱乐、制造、自动驾驶汽车或交通运输等行业中，这些行业中的每一个都
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,AIs that deeply affect them and these are the five layer stack Nvidia is at the lower level,\N深刻影响他们的AI，这五层架构是英伟达所处的底层。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the platform level.\N平台层面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:30.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason why we say that, you know,\N之所以这么说，你知道的，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:36.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're AI company that works with every single AI company in the world is because we're the platform by which\N我们是一家AI公司，与全球每一家AI公司合作，因为我们是它们背后的平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are able to work with all of these technology companies and all these application companies across all these industries.\N我们能够与所有这些科技公司以及各行业中的各类应用公司合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:45.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that is a platform that we created.\N这就是我们打造的平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the moat that people describe — not so much a moat,\N人们所说的护城河——与其说是一道护城河，不如说并非如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:55.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,but basically the the language by which all of these different applications and these\N但基本上，这些不同应用之间交流所使用的语言就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:05:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,different technologies speak to us is an architecture we invented 25 years ago called CUDA.\N不同的技术向我们诉说，这正是我们25年前发明的一种架构——CUDA。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on top of that CUDA libraries, a whole bunch of algorithms that we invented over the years and that is basically Nvidia's platform.\N此外还有 CUDA 库，以及我们多年来研发的一整套算法，这基本上构成了英伟达的平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:16.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end, we don't build self-driving cars, but we work with every single self-driving car company in the world.\N最终，我们并不自己制造自动驾驶汽车，而是与全球每一家自动驾驶汽车公司合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end, we don't discover drugs, but we just have we work with every single drug discovery company in the world.\N最终，我们并不自己发现药物，而是与全球每一家药物发现公司合作。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're the platform by which they build their things.\N我们是他们构建一切的平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're a platform company.\N我们是一家平台公司。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:35.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had half a dozen young kids come up to me today say Nvidia gave them a better gaming experience.\N今天有六七个年轻人跑来告诉我，英伟达让他们获得了更好的游戏体验。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean you all here before I before we invented the AI industry the first industry we created is the modern gaming industry.\N我的意思是，在我们发明人工智能产业之前，你们大家就已经在这里了，\N我们所创建的第一个产业就是现代游戏产业。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:45.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,You you don't know this.\N你不知道这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of this.\N我为此感到非常自豪。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is the world's largest gaming platform.\N英伟达是全球最大的游戏平台。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:51.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.89,0:05:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And probably didn't know that there that's how most of the kids were talking to me about that today.\N而且可能还不知道，今天大多数孩子跟我聊天时都是这么说话的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.84,0:06:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to see a 300 million active users.\N我想看到3亿活跃用户。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:05.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. a 100 million of them Nintendo Switch.\N嗯，一亿台任天堂Switch。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:05.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia's in that.\N英伟达也参与其中。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deeply serious.\N非常严肃。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:14.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think at this point we have to use every form of energy we can.\N我认为现在我们必须利用一切可利用的能源。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe we can't rely on the power grid.\N我相信我们不能依赖电网。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.12,0:06:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We got to build behind the meter.\N我们必须在电表后方建设。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.57,0:06:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We obviously need power generation systems.\N我们显然需要发电系统。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.37,0:06:31.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no question we should try to encourage and try to accelerate nuclear.\N毫无疑问，我们应该努力推动并加速核能发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to have energy growth very, very shortly.\N我们必须尽快实现能源增长。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:43.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, we're advancing our technology so quickly.\N与此同时，我们的技术正以极快的速度前进。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,No company our scale has ever introduced new generations every year.\N没有任何一家像我们这样规模的公司能每年推出新一代产品。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:53.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when I say we just ship a new chip every year, people, you know,\N当我说到我们每年都发布一款新芯片时，大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:07:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,when people because there's so many gamers in the world and they've known me for so long and when they think about what Nvidia builds,\N当人们想到全球有这么多玩家，而且他们认识我这么久，一想到英伟达打造的产品，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,they think it's a a a module that looks like a gaming graphics card, our GeForce graphics card, and they plug it into their PC.\N他们以为它是一个看起来像游戏显卡的模块，我们的 GeForce 显卡，然后插进他们的电脑里。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, a GPU for AI centers, AI AI data centers.\N嗯，用于AI中心、AI数据中心的GPU。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That GPU weighs two tons.\N这块GPU重达两吨。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has one and a half million parts.\N它有150万个零件。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It consumes 200,000 watts.\N它消耗20万瓦的功率。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It costs $3 million.\N成本三百万美元。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so anyhow,\N总之，不管怎样，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,the technology that we make each year allows us to\N我们每年研发的技术，使我们能够不断进步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:44.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,increase the performance at about the same power by many times.\N在功耗基本不变的情况下，性能提升数倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me just pick a number.\N让我随便选个数字。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Say five times or 10 times each year.\N每年说五次或十次。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result, our energy efficiency improves by five times or 10 times each year.\N因此，我们的能源效率每年提升五倍或十倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the problem is this.\N但问题是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:08:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're at the beginning of this technology buildout.\N我们正处在这一技术建设的起步阶段。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.85,0:08:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm improving the performance by a factor of 10 times each year, but demand is going up by a factor of 10,000 a million times each year.\N我每年将性能提升十倍，但需求每年却增长了一万倍，也就是一百万倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:11.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,No. AI is getting more compute intensive.\N不，AI 正变得越来越依赖算力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:12.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The adoption is going way up.\N采用率正在大幅上升。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've got all these exponentials.\N我这儿全是指数级的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.80,0:08:17.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we're going to keep chasing this.\N所以我们将继续追逐这一目标。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:21.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we're going to be completely dedicated to advancing the technology as fast as we can.\N我们将全力以赴，以最快的速度推进这项技术的发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:24.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the bottom line is we need energy.\N但归根结底，我们需要能源。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.69,0:08:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:30.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me how robots fit in with AI.\N告诉我机器人如何与人工智能结合。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:35.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, let me just give you one example of why it's around the corner.\N嗯，我举个例子，说明它为什么就在眼前。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know,\N你知道吗，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,these days you could describe you could describe in text and you give it to um a video AI and it generates a video.\N现在你只需用文字描述，然后交给视频AI，它就能生成视频。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys know this, right?\N你们知道这个，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.72,0:08:52.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,It actually from words you can generate a video.\N实际上，你可以用文字生成视频。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.\N好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:09:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's say the video is uh Jensen reaches over, picks up a cup.\N假设视频里是黄仁勋伸手拿起一个杯子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I take a picture of this screenshot, give it to the AI.\N所以我拍下这个截图，交给AI。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the starting starting condition.\N这就是起始条件。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I say, "Now cause Jensen to reach over and pick up the cup."\N我说：“现在让黄仁勋伸手拿起杯子。”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The AI creates pixel by pixel, token by token my arm picking up the cup.\NAI 逐像素、逐词元地生成我拿起杯子的手臂动作。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that everybody knows is possible today.\N而且大家都知道，如今这一切都是可能的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.90,0:09:23.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys have seen it.\N你们都看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.59,0:09:32.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the AI can't tell the difference between manipulating pixels versus manipulating a bunch of motors.\N事实上，AI无法区分操控像素和操控一堆电机之间的区别。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:39.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the idea that I can tell the robot pick up the cup is clearly just around the corner.\N所以，我能告诉机器人去拿杯子这个想法，显然就在眼前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:44.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just have to take that AI which currently sits in the cloud and we have\N我们只需将目前位于云端的AI搬出来即可
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:51.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,to put it into otherwise called embody it into a physical mechanical system which is called robotics.\N换句话说，就是将其具象化为一个物理机械系统，也就是机器人技术。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the AI is around the corner.\N所以，人工智能就在眼前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:59.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can see early evidence that the technology must be possible.\N我们已经看到早期迹象，表明这项技术是可行的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you, we're because we're running out of time.\N让我问你，因为我们时间不多了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:10.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, I was talking to a friend of mine who's a dean of a of a major research institute,\N呃，你知道吗，我刚跟一个朋友聊过，他是某大型研究机构的院长，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:15.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I asked him, I said, "How is your faculty dealing with uh with AI?"\N我问他：“你们学院是怎么应对人工智能的？”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:19.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he said, "Well, you know, the engineering faculty is excited.\N他说：“你知道的，工程学院的老师们都很兴奋。”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,They really think this is fabulous."\N他们真的觉得这太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,He said the science faculty is really curious and they think it potentially opens\N他说科学系的教授们非常好奇，认为这可能带来突破。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:35.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,up real opportunity and the humanities faculty thinks it's the end of the world.\N真正的机遇出现了，人文学院的教师却觉得世界末日到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um so it is a shorthand for the anxiety that people feel about the dark side of AI.\N所以，这其实是人们对AI阴暗面所产生焦虑的简写。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:52.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you how do you talk to us about that?\N你该怎么跟我们谈这个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:56.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um let me start from the from the end.\N嗯，让我从结尾开始说起。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:11:07.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no question that everyone's jobs profession will be affected by AI because\N毫无疑问，每个人的职业都将受到人工智能的影响，因为
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:13.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,the tasks within our jobs are going to be dramatically enhanced by AI.\N我们工作中各项任务将被人工智能大幅增强。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:14.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\N嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.47,0:11:18.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some jobs will become obsolete.\N一些工作将变得过时。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.31,0:11:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,New jobs are going to be created and every job will be changed.\N新工作将被创造出来，而每一份工作都将被改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that let me just I used two words just now and it's really important we think about these two words very differently.\N所以让我刚才用了两个词，这一点非常重要，我们必须对这两个词有截然不同的思考方式。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is task the other one is job.\N一个是任务，另一个是工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now it turns out I think it was something like seven eight years ago\N现在我才知道，大概是在七八年前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:50.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,a very important AI scientist maybe the most important AI scientist declared the first application\N一位非常重要的AI科学家，也许是最重要的AI科学家，宣布了首个应用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:57.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,for AI will be radiology because computer vision was the first breakthrough and that\N因为计算机视觉是首个重大突破，所以AI将走向放射科。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:12:03.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,in fact the entire radiology industry within five years will be completely transformed by AI.\N事实上，五年内整个放射科行业都将被人工智能彻底改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:13.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that in five years' time radiologists will all lose their jobs, and he advised that no one should be a radiologist.\N五年后，所有放射科医生都将失业，他建议没人应该当放射科医生。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:18.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was his advice and it was taken very seriously.\N这是他的建议，受到了高度重视。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:19.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now some five, six, seven,\N现在是五、六、七，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:26.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,eight years later every single radiology platform\N八年之后，每一家放射科平台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:32.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,has been completely transformed by AI 100%.\N已被人工智能彻底改变，达100%。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:41.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,every single radiology platform the number of radiologists has increased.\N每个放射科平台的放射科医生人数都在增加。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:44.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,The question is why?\N问题是为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:54.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because as it turns out studying the scans, studying the images is the task of a radiologist.\N之所以如此，是因为实际上，分析扫描图像正是放射科医生的工作。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:13:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal or the job of a radiologist is to diagnose disease.\N放射科医生的目标或工作就是诊断疾病。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:05.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is true for many many people.\N这对很多人来说都是真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,People say I don't need software engineers because apparently coding is going to be automated.\N有人说我不需要软件工程师，因为显然编程将被自动化。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.85,0:13:16.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've given AIs to every one of my software engineers and hardware engineers and engineers period.\N我已经把AI给了我的每一位软件工程师、硬件工程师，以及所有工程师。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,100% of NVIDIA has AI assistants, AI coders, and they're busier than ever.\N英伟达100%的员工都在使用AI助手和AI程序员，而且比以往任何时候都更忙碌。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.59,0:13:32.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the question is what is the task versus what is the job? no different than a financial analyst.\N因此问题在于，任务和工作分别是什么？这与金融分析师并无不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:38.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The task is messing around with spreadsheets, but the job is to give financial advice.\N这项任务只是在处理电子表格，但这份工作是提供财务建议。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The job is to help a customer.\N工作是帮助客户。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,The job is to analyze a market, make a prediction about market.\N工作是分析市场，预测市场走势。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:49.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so there's still the human factor is still quite significant.\N因此，人为因素仍然相当重要。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:14:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would just tell everyone before you decide that the the the that AI uh is something that you're you're you're worried about or scared about,\N在你们决定之前，我想提醒大家，如果你们对人工智能感到担忧或害怕，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:01.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,go engage it.\N去接触它。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go use it.\N去用吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:11.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even in the humanities, the fact of the matter is as without, you know, with AI today, my writing has improved.\N甚至在人文学科领域，事实是，如果没有AI，我的写作水平根本没法提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.51,0:14:13.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think the quality is.\N我认为质量不是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.03,0:14:22.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,It still writes in my my taste and my my ways, but my speed of writing has dramatically improved.\N它依然按照我的风格和方式书写，但我的写作速度已大幅提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I'm more productive today.\N所以我今天更高效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:26.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm still writing the original pieces.\N我还在写最初的那些作品。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:28.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have to write the original voice.\N我仍需撰写原始配音。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have to we I still have to create the original thought still has but every so often as you know when\N我仍然需要创造最初的念头，但时不时地，你知道的，当
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,we derive uh other speeches out of other previous speeches the concepts are very similar but the content the delivery the context is\N我们从以往的演讲中衍生出其他演讲，概念非常相似，但内容、表达方式和语境各不相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:51.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,so different we we now can use AI to help us regenerate the first draft you know so so for me u for\N所以我们现在可以用AI来帮助我们重写初稿，对我来说，这意义重大。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:15:00.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,the humanities I would just say original thought original writing your taste made with human hands are still always going to be valuable.\N人文学科方面，我想说的是，原创思想、原创写作，以及由人手打造的品味，始终都具有不可替代的价值。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I went in for an MRI recently.\N我最近去做了一次核磁共振检查。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,My wife said, "Make sure you take a picture.\N我老婆说：“一定要拍张照片。”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's a brain up there, but I'd like to see it.\N我觉得上面没大脑，但我倒想看看。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:10.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Prove there's something."\N证明确实有东西存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:12.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, and what what did you find out?\N呃，你查到什么结果了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,There was there was nothing.\N什么都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:19.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, she was right and I was wrong.\N我的意思是，她是对的，我错了。
